      "start_seconds": 9.18,
      "end_seconds": 12.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "no problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.77,
      "end_seconds": 19.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Mainly I've been feeling unwell. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.13,
      "end_seconds": 23.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.39,
      "end_seconds": 34.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "Oh, for three weeks, I'd say. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.54,
      "end_seconds": 37.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.29,
      "end_seconds": 61.65,
      "duration_seconds": 22.36,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get sensitivity to clothes touching as well. Uh, um, and there's burning pain before the rash as well, ten days now. The sensitivity to clothes touching? That's been for six months. As for sensitivity to clothes touching, it's worse with clothes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.85,
      "end_seconds": 66.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "have you had any rash across the midline?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.0,
      "end_seconds": 71.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "No, you know, no rash across the midline."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.48,
      "end_seconds": 77.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Did you get weakness, eye involvement or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.98,
      "end_seconds": 82.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.29,
      "end_seconds": 87.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "on the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.51,
      "end_seconds": 90.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.73,
      "end_seconds": 108.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Right, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.33,
      "end_seconds": 112.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "yes, high blood pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.53,
      "end_seconds": 123.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that clear. Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.33,
      "end_seconds": 136.46,
      "duration_seconds": 12.13,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. I grab fast food at lunch most days. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.84,
      "end_seconds": 140.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.49,
      "end_seconds": 148.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "Ah, I had a a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.45,
      "end_seconds": 153.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.18,
      "end_seconds": 156.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "my sister had breast cancer"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.38,
      "end_seconds": 165.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.85,
      "end_seconds": 174.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "Ramipril. I take it 5 milligrams, every morning. I'm on paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.99,
      "end_seconds": 187.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.12,
      "end_seconds": 191.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "no, not that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.16,
      "end_seconds": 194.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.02,
      "end_seconds": 207.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.1,
      "end_seconds": 236.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.8 degrees, BP is 112 over 78. And saturation 97 percent, pulse 84."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.18,
      "end_seconds": 242.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.99,
      "end_seconds": 246.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.97,
      "end_seconds": 251.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.36,
      "end_seconds": 273.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "There are grouped blisters on a red base along one band on the right side and and none cross the midline."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.06,
      "end_seconds": 285.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably shingles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.66,
      "end_seconds": 308.56,
      "duration_seconds": 11.9,
      "text": "keep the rash covered and stay away from pregnant women and newborn babies until it has crusted right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.08,
      "end_seconds": 313.69,
